    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood &amp; Bananas is a grand strategy game with a focus in economics during the cold war, a capitalism simulator where every country or company has their own goals and where you as the player is only a part of the world. Be a warlord by staging a mutiny or a benevolent ruler who focuses on diplomacy over war or the exact opposite, build the perfect army with different weapons, tanks and planes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be a country and increase your state power with money to kick out the companies or be a company who puppets countries with good business so you can make money and buy  the market provinces of a country, launch new products and change their prices to gain more money or gain more demand in a province, build factories and offices to expand your influence across North America, you could also hire mercenaries and take it by force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build infrastructure to have more buildings which will improve economy. Use buildings to harvest/mine/extract different resources, monopolize them and mark them up when entities have no choice but to buy them from you. Either you start as a person and work yourself up via the career tree and buy seats to become more powerful than your liege and coup them or play as any entity on the map (tribes not suggested). You can do all at once if you so please.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood &amp; Bananas is a grand strategy game with a focus in economics during the cold war, a capitalism simulator where every country or company has their own goals and where you as the player is only a part of the world. Be a warlord by staging a mutiny or a benevolent ruler who focuses on diplomacy over war or the exact opposite, build the perfect army with different weapons, tanks and planes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be a country and increase your state power with money to kick out the companies or be a company who puppets countries with good business so you can make money and buy  the market provinces of a country, launch new products and change their prices to gain more money or gain more demand in a province, build factories and offices to expand your influence across North America, you could also hire mercenaries and take it by force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build infrastructure to have more buildings which will improve economy. Use buildings to harvest/mine/extract different resources, monopolize them and mark them up when entities have no choice but to buy them from you. Either you start as a person and work yourself up via the career tree and buy seats to become more powerful than your liege and coup them or play as any entity on the map (tribes not suggested). You can do all at once if you so please.</p>",
    "short_description": "Enter the world of corporate politics, in this cold war grand strategy, become a monopoly of resources, buy the market, build an army, drop a nuke or hire a spy as you conspire against your peers and leaders. Become the greatest power via trade or war, in blood &amp; bananas",
